Are you saying that you cannot determine the truth of a statement like:

 (1)               e^x is the derivative of e^x.

Because you can make that statement in Lojban as well as in
English. If you cannot determine the truth of that, then I wouldn't
worry about determining the truth of a much more complex claim
like:

 (2)               John knows that e^x is the derivative of e^x
                     from mathematical reasoning.

If you don't believe (1) is true, why should you care whether
(2) is true?

